---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: A list of Atharva's featured software projects, each with a full case study.
permalink: /projects/
---
<h1>Projects</h1>
<p>Three projects, in the order I&rsquo;d actually walk you through them. Each one
  is generated from a Markdown file in <code>src/projects/</code> &mdash; this list
  and the pages it links to come from the same source.</p>

<ul class="card-grid">
  {%- for project in collections.projects %}
  <li>
    <article>
      <img src="{{ project.data.image }}" alt="{{ project.data.imageAlt }}" width="320" height="180">
      <h2><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ project.data.summary }}</p>
      <p class="tags">
        <span class="visually-hidden">Technologies used:</span>
        {%- for tech in project.data.stack %}
        <span class="tag">{{ tech }}</span>
        {%- endfor %}
      </p>
      <p><a href="{{ project.url }}">View case study &rarr;</a></p>
    </article>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
